{"id":"366c2e26a2b77ac2","group":"73","path":"73/73-thm-dpda-empty-stack-prefix-property.md","title":"确定性空栈接受与前缀性质","display":"thm-dpda-empty-stack-prefix-property — 确定性空栈接受与前缀性质","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-thm-dpda-empty-stack-prefix-property","aliases":["73-thm-dpda-empty-stack-prefix-property"],"display":"thm-dpda-empty-stack-prefix-property — 确定性空栈接受与前缀性质","depends_on":["[[73-df-deterministic-pushdown-automaton]]","[[73-df-prefix-free-language]]","[[73-df-pda-empty-stack-semantics]]"],"source_id":"HMU2007","source_ref":"§6.4, print pp. 252–257; PDF pp. 274–279; local DPDA closure/ambiguity interface","source_status":"third-edition-topic-mapped; inherited-local-review; not-a-line-by-line-source-proof-certificate","reviewed_on":"2026-10-24","legacy_source_id":"HU1979","legacy_source_ref":"§10.7, pp. 252–260, especially Theorem 10.12; scans 260–268","legacy_source_status":"book-based-local-formalization","revision_round":"pdf-third-edition-20261024","edition_role":"third-edition-core","third_edition_chapter":6},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-thm-dpda-empty-stack-prefix-property"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-thm-dpda-empty-stack-prefix-property</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-dpda-empty-stack-prefix-property — 确定性空栈接受与前缀性质"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e63e7d14efa1e2c3\" href=\"?note=e63e7d14efa1e2c3\" title=\"73-df-deterministic-pushdown-automaton\">73-df-deterministic-pushdown-automaton</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"f0364f297bdbfa15\" href=\"?note=f0364f297bdbfa15\" title=\"73-df-prefix-free-language\">73-df-prefix-free-language</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5bc7edf5698ebdc7\" href=\"?note=5bc7edf5698ebdc7\" title=\"73-df-pda-empty-stack-semantics\">73-df-pda-empty-stack-semantics</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_id","html":"HMU2007"},{"key":"source_ref","html":"§6.4, print pp. 252–257; PDF pp. 274–279; local DPDA closure/ambiguity interface"},{"key":"source_status","html":"third-edition-topic-mapped; inherited-local-review; not-a-line-by-line-source-proof-certificate"},{"key":"reviewed_on","html":"2026-10-24"},{"key":"legacy_source_id","html":"HU1979"},{"key":"legacy_source_ref","html":"§10.7, pp. 252–260, especially Theorem 10.12; scans 260–268"},{"key":"legacy_source_status","html":"book-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"pdf-third-edition-20261024"},{"key":"edition_role","html":"third-edition-core"},{"key":"third_edition_chapter","html":"6"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)\">\\(\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\\subseteq\\Sigma^*\">\\(L\\subseteq\\Sigma^*\\)</span>。DPDA/DCFL、前缀性质、空栈语言见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"e63e7d14efa1e2c3\" href=\"?note=e63e7d14efa1e2c3\" title=\"73-df-deterministic-pushdown-automaton\">73-df-deterministic-pushdown-automaton</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"f0364f297bdbfa15\" href=\"?note=f0364f297bdbfa15\" title=\"73-df-prefix-free-language\">73-df-prefix-free-language</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"5bc7edf5698ebdc7\" href=\"?note=5bc7edf5698ebdc7\" title=\"73-df-pda-empty-stack-semantics\">73-df-pda-empty-stack-semantics</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}dpda\\text{-}empty\\text{-}stack\\text{-}prefix\\text{-}property}\\vdash\n(\\exists M\\in\\mathsf{PDA}_{\\Sigma}\\;[\\operatorname{DPDA}_{\\Sigma}(M)\\land L=L_{\\varnothing}(M)])\\leftrightarrow(L\\in\\mathsf{DCFL}_{\\Sigma}\\land\\operatorname{PrefixFree}_{\\Sigma}(L))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}dpda\\text{-}empty\\text{-}stack\\text{-}prefix\\text{-}property}\\vdash\n(\\exists M\\in\\mathsf{PDA}_{\\Sigma}\\;[\\operatorname{DPDA}_{\\Sigma}(M)\\land L=L_{\\varnothing}(M)])\\leftrightarrow(L\\in\\mathsf{DCFL}_{\\Sigma}\\land\\operatorname{PrefixFree}_{\\Sigma}(L))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>空栈后没有一步后继；确定性使同一前缀的运行一致，故接受一个词后不可能继续接受其真扩展。反向可把接受前缀无关语言的 DPDA 规范化，使成功结束时清空栈；终态转空栈只在此前提下保持确定性。书中通过 LR(0) 与前缀性质给出对应。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-deterministic-pushdown-automaton","status":"resolved","id":"e63e7d14efa1e2c3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-deterministic-pushdown-automaton]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-prefix-free-language","status":"resolved","id":"f0364f297bdbfa15","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-prefix-free-language]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-pda-empty-stack-semantics","status":"resolved","id":"5bc7edf5698ebdc7","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-pda-empty-stack-semantics]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-deterministic-pushdown-automaton","status":"resolved","id":"e63e7d14efa1e2c3","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)$，$L\\subseteq\\Sigma^*$。DPDA/DCFL、前缀性质、空栈语言见 [[73-df-dete